    "document": "Chapter Approved",
    "section": "Mission Sequence",
    "summary": "At the end of every turn, each player checks their Secondary Missions, the active player first:\n\n1. You may take the VP on each card whose conditions you met. If you take it while using [Tactical](vsdata:core-rule/chapter-approved.tactical-secondary-missions) missions, discard that card as achieved; a Tactical card you don't score stays active.\n2. On your own turn, if you use Tactical missions, you can drop one or more active cards to gain 1CP in total.",
